<disclaimer-bar/><view class="page"><view class="hero"><view class="eyebrow">理性选择 · 有数可依</view><view class="title">把预算放在号码前面</view><view class="subtitle">快乐8 选十 · 本地规则辅助，不作开奖预测</view></view><button class="primary" bindtap="generate">快捷选号 · 生成候选号码</button><view class="card"><view class="row"><view class="section">本月预算</view><text class="tag">{{summary.month}}</text></view><view><text class="big">¥{{summary.spent}}</text><text class="muted"> / ¥{{summary.budget.monthly}}</text></view><view class="progress"><view class="fill" style="width:{{summary.percent}}%"></view></view><view class="muted {{summary.over?'danger':''}}">{{summary.over?'已超过月预算，请暂停并审视支出':'预算剩余 ¥'+summary.remaining}} · 单期上限 ¥{{summary.budget.perIssue}}</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="ledger">记一笔 / 查看账本</button></view><view class="card"><view class="section">最近投注记录</view><view wx:if="{{!records.length}}" class="empty">还没有记录，记账从第一笔开始</view><view wx:for="{{records}}" wx:key="id" class="record"><view class="row"><text>{{item.play}} · {{item.issue}}</text><text>¥{{item.amount}}</text></view><view class="muted">{{item.time}} <text class="danger" wx:if="{{item.over}}"> · 超限确认记录</text></view></view></view><view class="footer">记录由您手动填写，不代表通过本工具购票。禁止代售。</view></view>
